      <p class="small muted auth-help"><% if (individualAccounts) { %>New to <%= brand %>? <a href="/signup">Create an individual account</a>. <a href="/password/forgot">Forgot your password?</a> (individual accounts)<br><% } %>Need help signing in? <a href="/contact">Contact <%= brand %></a>.<% if (publicApply) { %> New training provider? <a href="/apply">Apply to become an Authorized Training Provider</a>.<% } else { %> New training provider? <a href="/partners">Learn about the Authorized Training Provider program</a>.<% } %></p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <aside class="auth-right" aria-label="What you can do after signing in">
    <div class="auth-inner">
      <% if (individualAccounts) { %><h2>For individuals</h2>
      <ul class="auth-list">
        <li>See the credentials recorded under your email address</li>
        <li>Download your records and share their verification links</li>
        <li>Manage your profile and communication preferences</li>
      </ul><% } %>
      <h2>For Authorized Training Providers</h2>
      <ul class="auth-list">
        <li>Manage your organization profile and authorized scope</li>
        <li>Report completions by CSV, Excel or the REST API</li>
        <li>Track your application, titles, trainers and level</li>
        <li>Download records and verification links</li>
        <li>See invoices and billing</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>For <%= brand %> staff</h2>
      <ul class="auth-list">
        <li>Review applications and requests</li>
        <li>Maintain the public register of providers</li>
        <li>Monitor issuance, audit cases and records</li>
        <li>Oversee verification and compliance</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="auth-verify">Verifying a credential? <a href="/verify">Go to the verification portal</a>.</p>
      <p class="auth-legal small"><%= brandDescriptor %></p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
</body>
</html>
